    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d474-a2">

                <pb facs="0527" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg477"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Madriz to the Governor and Intendent of San Juan
                        del Norte.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bluefields</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April 2,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Norberto Argüello, who killed an American
                    citizen, has escaped from the jail at Rama. If he comes to San Juan del Norte
                    arrest him and send him under a strong guard to the governor (of Pol.) of the
                    district of Siquia, who is the proper magistrate to take cognizance of his
                    case.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Madriz.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
